---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Own a JaniCrew
permalink: /own-a-janicrew/
description: "Own and operate your own commercial cleaning business under the JaniCrew name. Independently owned, locally operated, backed by the JaniCrew Standard."
eyebrow: Own a JaniCrew
heading: Run your own cleaning business under a name people trust.
lede: "Operate your own commercial cleaning business under the JaniCrew name in an agreed territory."
heroDark: true
heroImage: redPickup
heroLabel: Red JaniCrew pickup outside a client building
heroRatio: 16/9
heroCtas:
  - label: Start the conversation
    url: "#enquire"
    style: accent
  - label: Call (800) 355-2648
    url: "tel:+18003552648"
    style: secondary
hasForm: true
---
{% include "partials/hero.njk" %}

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">The model</p>
      <h2>Your business. Our name. One standard.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      {% for m in franchise.model %}
      <div class="feature">
        <span class="feature__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h3>{{ m.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ m.body }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      {% set img = images | slot("officeVacuuming") %}
      {% set slotLabel = "Crew member vacuuming an office" %}
      {% set ratio = "1/1" %}
      {% set eager = false %}
      {% include "partials/image-slot.njk" %}
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Who it's for</p>
      <h2>People who already take pride in the work.</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        {% for w in franchise.whoFor %}<li>{{ w }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--dark">
  <div class="container split split--wide-text">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">What you commit to</p>
      <h2>The Standard, from the other side.</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        {% for c in franchise.commit %}<li>{{ c }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top: var(--space-5)"><a class="btn btn--on-dark" href="/why-janicrew/">Read the full JaniCrew Standard</a></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      {% set img = images | slot("poloLogo") %}
      {% set slotLabel = "The JaniCrew diamond on a crew polo" %}
      {% set ratio = "16/9" %}
      {% set eager = false %}
      {% include "partials/image-slot.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it starts</p>
      <h2>Four steps, no pressure.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps steps--row">
      {% for s in franchise.steps %}
      <li>
        <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ s.body }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt" aria-labelledby="license-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 id="license-heading">How the JaniCrew license works</h2>
      <p class="lede">Explore what the agreement covers and what you’ll review before deciding whether to proceed.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/licensing/">Explore JaniCrew licensing</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="enquire">
  <div class="container with-aside">
    <div>
      <div class="section-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">Enquire</p>
        <h2>Start the conversation.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Tell us where you are and what you clean today. We will reply within a few business days.</p>
      </div>
      {% include "partials/franchise-form.njk" %}
    </div>
    <aside class="aside-card" aria-label="Contact">
      <h2>Prefer to talk?</h2>
      <a class="phone" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
      <p>Ask about licensing the JaniCrew name.</p>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Independently owned and operated</li>
        <li>One written standard</li>
        <li>Your community, your accounts</li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
